ymptote and in  order to find that slant asymptote what  you would do is you would do long  division polynomial long division to  find the equation that slant asymptote  if you want to find out more about  graphing how to actually graph these  entire rational functions follow me over  to that video right there and we'll  discuss how to do all the different  aspects of graphing rational functions  I'll see you over in that video
 

